WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.880 --> 00:00:06.770
One of the cool things about
Amplifier Agent is that it integrates

2
00:00:06.820 --> 00:00:09.870
some of the features that our team
uses to gain a lot of leverage with AI

3
00:00:09.920 --> 00:00:12.240
in our day-to-day work,
especially as a team.

4
00:00:12.440 --> 00:00:13.970
Two of those I want
to highlight in this video

5
00:00:14.020 --> 00:00:16.240
are Context Intelligence and Smart Tools.

6
00:00:16.840 --> 00:00:18.620
Let's look at an example scenario.

7
00:00:18.800 --> 00:00:21.920
Lately, our team has made a lot of videos,
just like this one.

8
00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:24.590
But depending on how you steer it,
what models you use,

9
00:00:24.640 --> 00:00:26.730
what reasoning is set,
the tools the agent has access to,

10
00:00:26.780 --> 00:00:28.070
and the list just goes on and on,

11
00:00:28.120 --> 00:00:30.180
your experience can be wildly different.

12
00:00:30.440 --> 00:00:33.360
Many of us find skills, tools,
and workflows that work.

13
00:00:33.420 --> 00:00:36.200
But what one person learns
typically stays with that person.

14
00:00:36.380 --> 00:00:38.290
With Context Intelligence
in Amplifier Agent,

15
00:00:38.340 --> 00:00:40.130
that doesn't have to be the case anymore.

16
00:00:40.180 --> 00:00:42.950
We can choose to share our session's
learnings into a shared graph

17
00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:45.020
so that anyone on the team can use it.

18
00:00:45.260 --> 00:00:47.250
You can ask what the team
uses to make videos,

19
00:00:47.300 --> 00:00:49.740
or ask the best way to do a voice-over.

20
00:00:49.800 --> 00:00:51.910
And each answer comes from real work,

21
00:00:51.960 --> 00:00:53.960
and it has the context
of where it came from.

22
00:00:54.640 --> 00:00:56.570
Then we can go one step further

23
00:00:56.620 --> 00:00:59.230
by taking what we learned
and capturing it as a Smart Tool.

24
00:00:59.280 --> 00:01:00.650
Our team's video know-how,

25
00:01:00.700 --> 00:01:03.580
so that then anyone else can use it.

26
00:01:04.200 --> 00:01:06.450
Amplifier Agent knows how
to use the Smart Tool Creator,

27
00:01:06.500 --> 00:01:09.140
so that it can correctly package it up.

28
00:01:09.460 --> 00:01:10.870
We share that Smart Tool with the team,

29
00:01:10.920 --> 00:01:13.510
and now when another
team asks for a video,

30
00:01:13.560 --> 00:01:16.240
Amplifier Agent finds
the tool and uses it.

31
00:01:16.300 --> 00:01:18.330
The next video is made
with that packaged tool

32
00:01:18.380 --> 00:01:21.770
that contains all the skills, tools,
and models already configured,

33
00:01:21.820 --> 00:01:23.860
so that they can hit the ground running.

34
00:01:24.700 --> 00:01:26.570
If you want this
experience in your product,

35
00:01:26.620 --> 00:01:29.410
get started by asking your coding
agent to install the skill,

36
00:01:29.460 --> 00:01:32.180
and tell it what you want
to build with Amplifier Agent.
